{"id":"preciso","lemma":"preciso","pos":"adj","rank":2461,"glosses":["precise","necessary"],"ipa":"/pɾeˈθiso/","forms":{"feminine":"precisa","masculinePlural":"precisos","femininePlural":"precisas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-preciso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sé más preciso.","en":"Be more precise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441399","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"more"},null]},{"text":"Esas fueron sus palabras precisas.","en":"Those were his actual words.","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"word","l":"palabra"},null]},{"text":"Mi reloj es preciso.","en":"My watch is accurate.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800852","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"clock"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Estos datos no son nada precisos.","en":"This data isn't accurate at all.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"data"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"nothing"},null]},{"text":"En ese preciso momento se paró el autobús.","en":"Just at that time, the bus stopped.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687645","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"moment, instant"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to stop, halt","l":"parar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"bus, coach"}]}]}